# The SNES-scale hero: a side-view idle (legs still while the body above them breathes;
# the first frame held longer) and an 8-frame walk toward the camera. pivot is the pixel
# under his feet, which anim and onion line frames up on: 23,47 in the 48x48 idle frames,
# 12,31 in the 24x32 walk.
pxart 1
@palette hero-palette.px

@anim idle/right ms=240 pivot=23,47
@anim walk/down ms=110 pivot=12,31

@frame idle/right/0 ms=400
